{"id":"temporale","lemma":"temporale","pos":"adj","rank":2337,"glosses":["time; temporal","worldly, temporal, secular","of time, temporal"],"ipa":"/tem.poˈra.le/","forms":{"plural":"temporali"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3b/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-DivoLetto-temporale.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ho davvero paura dei temporali.","en":"I'm really scared of thunderstorms.","words":[{"g":"have","l":"avere"},{"g":"really, in fact"},{"g":"fear"},{"g":"some"},null]},{"text":"Eravamo in ritardo a causa del temporale.","en":"We were late because of the storm.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},null,null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"cause"},{"g":"of the"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"late"]]},{"text":"Abbiamo avuto molti temporali questo inverno.","en":"We've had a lot of storms this winter.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"avere"},{"g":"to have","l":"avere"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot","l":"molto"},null,{"g":"this"},{"g":"winter"}]},{"text":"Se non fosse stato per il temporale, sarei arrivato prima.","en":"If it had not been for the storm, I would have arrived earlier.","words":[null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},{"g":"successful"},{"g":"before"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"except, but"]]},{"text":"Io ho davvero paura dei temporali.","en":"I'm really scared of thunderstorms.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avere"},{"g":"really, in fact"},{"g":"fear"},{"g":"some"},null]}]}